  "Figures are in whole lakh, so the page's own sums hold to rounding only.",
  "A 3-for-1 bonus issue in 2025 quadrupled the shares: last year's shares are its share capital times four (the printed FY25 earnings per share, 5.78, is restated the same way), so values per share compare with today's price.",
  "The model has no row for exceptional items: the past folds them into other expenses (a cost is added, a gain taken off), so the model's profit before tax is the filing's. FY25's exceptional gain (2,418) is taken off other expenses.",
  "The filing does not split interest on leases out of finance costs, so all of it is interest on borrowings and the rate on borrowings that comes out is high; interest on leases is left at nil.",
  "The company prints no trade receivables (a cash retailer): receivables are nil.",
  "The second half holds the festive and wedding months, so the rest of the year's revenue per store per day is typed above the first half's."
